  "description": "“W-Wait! Hyunseok, if we keep doing this, we’ll really get caught!”\n\nDo Hyunseok, Mi-joo’s longtime unrequited love, and her friend from next door.\n\nShe’s kept her feelings hidden, afraid they might not even remain friends.\n\n“Do Hyunseok, down there….”\n\nBy chance, she ends up trapped in a closet with her childhood friend.\n\n“This happened because of you. So take responsibility, Choi Mi-joo.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12783095), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/closet_friends)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14416722), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/closet_friends_15) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/in-the-closet-with-my-childhood-friend/list?title_no=8650), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/in-the-closet-with-my-childhood-friend/list?title_no=10501), [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance-m/in-the-closet-with-my-childhood-friend/list?title_no=10148)",
